<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 9.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 9.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, June 9:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,667.40 (1,660.60)	CHF  1,143.60 (1,150.50)</p>
<p>    DEM    959.38 (961.05)	  GBP  2,702.40 (2,705.90)</p>
<p>    ATS    136.33 (136.62)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $37.52 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$31.88 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $69.40 million ($23.97 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
